duct, called his past attacks "unprofessional and uncalled for", took time off to work on how he responds to people, and returned to maintaining 4.19 in October 2018. Awards: 2012 Millennium Technology Prize, 2014 IEEE Computer Pioneer Award, 2018 IEEE Masaru Ibuka Consumer Electronics Award.
